title: Dialogues_Ryoma
---
<<declare $visitedYetRyoma = false>>

<<if $dialogPhase == "start" or $dialogPhase == "">>
    <<jump Start_Ryoma>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "repeat">>
    <<jump Repeat>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "quest_taken">>
    <<jump Quest_Taken_Ryoma>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "quest_taken2">>
    <<jump Quest_Taken_Ryoma2>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "quest_taken_return">>
    <<jump Quest_Taken_Return_Ryoma>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "quest_complete">>
    <<jump Quest_Complete_Ryoma>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "quest_complete_return">>
    <<jump Quest_Complete_Return_Ryoma>>
<<else>>
    Ryoma: What the. The current phase: {$dialogPhase} . Do your job bro.
<<endif>>
===

title: Start_Ryoma
---
<<set $visitedYetRyoma = true>>
???: ......
???: ......
???: ...... ...... ......
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "NPC">>
???: ...what are you looking at? Who even are you? 
    -> Just passing by.
        ???: Ah, I see.
        ???: Then why don't you go back out where you came from?
        ???: I'm not interested in dealing with an intruder...
            -> Don't be so clumsy, boy.
                ???: ...not in a mood to listen to the intruder...
                ???: Whatever. You're already in my home. What can I do.
                Ryoma: I'm Ryoma...I live here with my older brother.
                Ryoma: ... *yawn*.
                    -> Are you bored?
                        Ryoma: ...kind of.
                        Ryoma: If I can play tennis with Ralph...
                            -> Can't you play it then?
                                <<jump Start_Ryoma_2>>
                                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
                            -> Leave.    
                                <<dialogPhaseGetter2 NPC "repeat">>
                                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>               
===

title: Repeat
---
Ryoma: ...what. Why not do your own business?
    -> I'm sorry for staying in front of you.
        Ryoma: ...don't need to apologize.
        Ryoma: Anyway, I'm bored. I want to play tennis...
            -> Then play it.
                <<jump Start_Ryoma_2>>
===

title: Start_Ryoma_2
---
Ryoma: ...I can't.
Ryoma: You'll need some tennis balls to play tennis, don't ya think?
Ryoma: I have my balls...locked up in the closet over there.
Ryoma: The closet has a lock with a password...but I forgot them.
Ryoma: They're stored in my pc on my desk tho.
    -> Why can't you just go up to your pc and check it on?
        Ryoma: Hey, this bed is too comfortable for me to wake up.
        Ryoma: Unless you pick up the tennis balls for me...
        Ryoma: I can show you what 'true tennis' is.
            -> ...fine. Let me do it for you.
                Ryoma: Actually? Hmm...not bad.
                <<set $dialogPhase = "quest_taken">>
                <<dialogPhaseGetter2 NPC "quest_taken">>
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
            -> Ignore and leave.
                Ryoma: Hmm...then why'd you came up to me then?
                Ryoma: You still have lots to work on...your behavior, as a human being.
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===

title: Quest_Taken_Ryoma
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "NPC">>
Ryoma: The password for the closet lock is written in the pc.
Ryoma: ...don't make me repeat twice. It's annoying.
    -> Does the pc also have password?
        Ryoma: Oh. Right...
        Ryoma: Just realized...the pc is my brother's, so I actually don't know about that one.
            -> Who else knows about the pc password?
                Ryoma: Probably Ralph...? I saw him logging into Ryoga's pc for his school work a few times.
                Ryoma: Oh, Ryoga's my brother's name by the way.
                <<set $dialogPhase = "quest_taken2">>
                <<dialogPhaseGetter2 NPC "quest_taken2">>
                <<updateRalphPhase NPC "quest_taken">>
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
            -> Then how do you know about that...?
                Ryoma: Why not? I live here. I see what my brother does.
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
    -> Got it.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===

title: Quest_Taken_Ryoma2
---
Ryoma: So...did you tried opening the closet?
===

title: Quest_Complete_Ryoma
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "NPC">>
<<dialogPhaseGetter2 NPC "quest_complete">>
<<updateRalphPhase NPC "quest_complete">>
Ryoma: You actually got me this...
Ryoma: Hmm, not bad at all.
    -> At least can I have a 'thank you'?
        Ryoma: Alright, alright......thanks a lot.
        Ryoma: As promised, I'll go out and show you the 'true tennis'.
        <<dialogPhaseGetter2 NPC "quest_complete_return">>
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===

title: Quest_Taken_Return_Ryoma
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "NPC">>
Ryoma: Did you find the code in the PC yet?
Ryoma: Unlock the closet and bring me the tennis balls.
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===

title: Quest_Complete_Return_Ryoma
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "NPC">>
Ryoma: ...what.
Ryoma: Do you still have something to do?
    -> Is it true that you were a pro tennis player?
        Ryoma: Uh...kind of.
        Ryoma: I played first for team US...then changed to team Japan.
        Ryoma: Everyone worked hard to beat against Spain.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
    -> I heard you went from team US to Japan in the U-17 tornament.
        Ryoma: ......
        Ryoma: It's not that I didn't like the team. Ralph is a pretty nice guy.
        Ryoma: Just...I wasn't sure where I actually belong.
        Ryoma: Then Ralph told me to follow where my heart went, so I joined team Japan.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
    -> Who's Ryoga?
        Ryoma: He's pretty annoying, loud, but kinda cool and daring guy.
        Ryoma: All he does is teasing me and runnig away...
        Ryoma: Playing and winning against him in tennis...that's my ultimate goal.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
    -> Nothing, bye.
        Ryoma: ...see ya in the court, then.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===